      <title>Zypper - openSUSE&#39;s command line software manager</title>
      <subtitle></subtitle>
      <track>openSUSE</track>
      <type></type>
      <language></language>
      <abstract>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;Zypper is a command line software management tool using the ZYpp library. It can be used to manage repositories, search for packages, install them, keep them up to date and more.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </abstract>
      <description>&#xA;&lt;p&gt;This talk will highlight it&amp;#39;s most interesting features, tips &amp;amp; tricks, and future plans.&#xA;&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  </description>
